1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,547
Domi is a diary for home-visit healthcare

2
00:00:02,547 --> 00:00:04,601
that refills itself when patients cancel.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,536
A cancellation costs a home-visit practice more

4
00:00:07,536 --> 00:00:09,571
than a clinic, because the clinician is

5
00:00:09,571 --> 00:00:11,607
already on the road and the gap

6
00:00:11,607 --> 00:00:13,643
is too short to fill by ringing

7
00:00:13,643 --> 00:00:13,933
round.

8
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:17,428
The refill engine ranks candidates by clinical

9
00:00:17,428 --> 00:00:20,026
priority, locality, days waiting and preferred clinician,

10
00:00:20,026 --> 00:00:22,253
and shows the reasons for each.

11
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:25,521
Patients can cancel by texting CANCEL, which

12
00:00:25,521 --> 00:00:27,891
starts the refill with no staff involved.

13
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:30,768
Plenty of systems keep a diary; Domi

14
00:00:30,768 --> 00:00:32,745
acts on the gap by finding who

15
00:00:32,745 --> 00:00:34,723
fits it, asking them by text and

16
00:00:34,723 --> 00:00:35,853
booking the first yes.

17
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:38,113
Find out more at the link.
